Third-party test material, used only by the conformance tests and not shipped in the library jar.

schemas/ and examples/
  From https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix2-json-schemas
  commit 9af1db41b7b86c06324f899649ae83480134f66e; file contents unmodified,
  examples/threat-reports/ flattened into examples/.

spec-2.1-examples.json
  The JSON examples from "STIX Version 2.1", OASIS Standard, 10 June 2021,
  https://docs.oasis-open.org/cti/stix/v2.1/os/stix-v2.1-os.html
  (Copyright (c) OASIS Open 2021), grouped by type, keeping only the examples
  that validate against the schemas above.

